<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 41 0 R
/T (Explanation: The parent component now owns the single price state. It passes the current price and setPrice function to PriceInput through props. PriceInput changes the shared state, and PriceDisplay receives the same updated value. Because there is only one source of truth, both components remain synchronized.)
